            ["int.bit_count"] = "bit_count($self, /)\n--\n\nNumber of ones in the binary representation of the absolute value of self.\n\nAlso known as the population count.\n\n>>> bin(13)\n'0b1101'\n>>> (13).bit_count()\n3",
